# Client & admin UI

- **Client** (`apps/client`): player-facing Vite + React + Clerk. Features: `core`, `auth`, `cards`, `decks`, `chat`.
- **Admin** (`apps/admin`): ops dashboard; same Clerk app; requires user public metadata `{ "role": "admin" }`. Features: `core`, `auth`, `cards`, `sets`, `etl-syncs`.

Architecture (feature folders, `api`/`hooks`/`lib`, TanStack Query, `@respark/ui/lib`): see **Vite React apps** in [`js-ts-quality`](js-ts-quality.mdc).

READMEs: [`apps/client`](../../apps/client) (via root README), [`apps/admin/README.md`](../../apps/admin/README.md).

## Commands

- Dev: `npm run dev` / `task admin:dev` (or root npm scripts).
- Build: `task client:build` / `task admin:build`
- Deploy: `task client:deploy` / `task admin:deploy` (bake `VITE_API_URL` from Terraform `api_url`)

## Conventions

- Only `VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY` in Vite apps — never the secret key.
- Prefer existing UI primitives from `@respark/ui/lib`; avoid one-off card chrome in heroes/marketing unless the design system requires it.
- Match Prettier (no semicolons, single quotes) and ESLint flat config at repo root.
- ESLint ignores generated `packages/ui/src/lib/**`; don’t fight shadcn output unless necessary. Add new shadcn components via `packages/ui/components.json`.
